{"seq":1,"slug":"nextjs-app-router","title":"Next.js App Router 架构与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-server-components/ecosystem/nextjs-app-router","wordCount":1142,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"next-js-app-router-架构与实践\">Next.js App Router 架构与实践</h1><p>Next.js App Router 是 RSC 规范在框架层的完整实现——它不仅提供了 Server Components 的运行时环境，还围绕 RSC 架构设计了文件系统路由、嵌套布局、流式渲染管线、数据缓存策略和部署优化等完整的工程基础设施。理解 App Router 的架构约定，是在生产环境中落地 RSC 的实操前提。</p>\n<p>2026 年，App Router 已进入成熟阶段。早期的缓存行为不可预测问题在 Next.js 15+ 中被修正（默认不缓存），Turbopack 取代 Webpack 成为默认打包器，<code>&#39;use cache&#39;</code> 指令趋于稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>文件系统路由</strong>：<code>app/</code> 目录下的文件夹结构即路由结构——每个文件夹是一个路由段，路由段内的特殊文件（<code>page.tsx</code>、<code>layout.tsx</code> 等）控制该段行为</li>\n<li><strong>嵌套布局（Nested Layouts）</strong>：每个路由段可定义 <code>layout.tsx</code>，它在客户端导航时不重新挂载——跨页面 UI 状态（侧边栏、导航栏）天然保持</li>\n<li><strong>特殊文件约定</strong>：<code>loading.tsx</code>（路由级 Suspense）、<code>error.tsx</code>（错误恢复）、<code>not-found.tsx</code>（404）、<code>template.tsx</code>（每次重建的布局）</li>\n<li><strong>路由组 <code>(name)/</code></strong>：圆括号文件夹不参与 URL 路径，用于按功能域组织代码共享独立布局</li>\n<li><strong>平行路由 <code>@slot/</code></strong>：同一布局中同时渲染多个页面——独立加载和导航，适用于仪表盘多面板场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"文件系统路由与特殊文件约定\">文件系统路由与特殊文件约定</h2><p>App Router 的路由基于 <code>app/</code> 目录的文件系统结构。每个文件夹代表一个路由段（route segment），路由段内的特殊命名文件控制该段的行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/&#10;├── layout.tsx          # 根布局（所有页面共享）&#10;├── page.tsx            # 首页 /&#10;├── loading.tsx         # 根路由加载 UI&#10;├── error.tsx           # 根路由错误 UI&#10;├── not-found.tsx       # 404 页面&#10;├── products/&#10;│   ├── layout.tsx      # 产品区布局&#10;│   ├── page.tsx        # /products&#10;│   ├── loading.tsx     # /products 加载 UI&#10;│   └── [id]/&#10;│       ├── page.tsx    # /products/:id&#10;│       └── error.tsx   # 产品详情错误 UI&#10;├── (marketing)/        # 路由组（不影响 URL）&#10;│   ├── about/page.tsx  # /about&#10;│   └── blog/page.tsx   # /blog&#10;└── api/&#10;    └── webhooks/route.ts  # API Route Handler\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── layout.tsx          # 根布局（所有页面共享）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── page.tsx            # 首页 /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── loading.tsx         # 根路由加载 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── error.tsx           # 根路由错误 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── not-found.tsx       # 404 页面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── products/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── layout.tsx      # 产品区布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── page.tsx        # /products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── loading.tsx     # /products 加载 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── [id]/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── page.tsx    # /products/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── error.tsx   # 产品详情错误 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── (marketing)/        # 路由组（不影响 URL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── about/page.tsx  # /about</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── blog/page.tsx   # /blog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── api/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── webhooks/route.ts  # API Route Handler</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特殊文件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>组件类型</th>\n<th>渲染行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>layout.tsx</code></td>\n<td>共享 UI 外壳，跨导航保持状态</td>\n<td>Server (默认)</td>\n<td>不随导航重新渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>page.tsx</code></td>\n<td>路由段的唯一入口 UI</td>\n<td>Server (默认)</td>\n<td>每次导航重新渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loading.tsx</code></td>\n<td>即时加载 UI（路由级 Suspense）</td>\n<td>Server</td>\n<td>导航时立即显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>error.tsx</code></td>\n<td>错误恢复 UI</td>\n<td>Client (必须)</td>\n<td>子树异常时显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>not-found.tsx</code></td>\n<td>404 UI</td>\n<td>Server (默认)</td>\n<td><code>notFound()</code> 触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>template.tsx</code></td>\n<td>类似 layout 但每次导航重建</td>\n<td>Server (默认)</td>\n<td>导航时销毁重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>route.ts</code></td>\n<td>API 端点（非页面）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>HTTP handler</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"布局嵌套与状态保持\">布局嵌套与状态保持</h2><p>App Router 的杀手级特性之一是嵌套布局（Nested Layouts）。每个路由段可以定义自己的 <code>layout.tsx</code>，它在客户端导航时不会重新挂载——这意味着导航栏状态、侧边栏滚动位置、播放器状态等跨页面 UI 天然保持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/layout.tsx — 根布局&#10;export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;html lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;body&gt;&#10;        &lt;Header /&gt;          {/* 全站共享，永不重建 */}&#10;        &lt;main&gt;{children}&lt;/main&gt;&#10;        &lt;Footer /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/body&gt;&#10;    &lt;/html&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}&#10;&#10;// app/dashboard/layout.tsx — 仪表盘布局&#10;export default function DashboardLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;flex&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;DashboardSidebar /&gt;  {/* 仪表盘子页切换时保持 */}&#10;      &lt;section className=&quot;flex-1&quot;&gt;{children}&lt;/section&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/layout.tsx — 根布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RootLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReactNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">html lang</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zh-CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Header </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 全站共享，永不重建 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{children}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Footer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">html</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/dashboard/layout.tsx — 仪表盘布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DashboardLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReactNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flex\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DashboardSidebar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 仪表盘子页切换时保持 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">section className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flex-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{children}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">section</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[RootLayout - 永不重建] --&gt; B[Header]&#10;    A --&gt; C[DashboardLayout - 仪表盘内导航时保持]&#10;    C --&gt; D[DashboardSidebar - 保持滚动位置和展开状态]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Page - 随导航重新渲染]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Footer]&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;导航 /dashboard/analytics → /dashboard/settings&quot;&#10;        G[RootLayout ✓保持] --&gt; H[DashboardLayout ✓保持]&#10;        H --&gt; I[新的 Page 组件渲染]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    A[RootLayout - 永不重建] --&gt; B[Header]\n    A --&gt; C[DashboardLayout - 仪表盘内导航时保持]\n    C --&gt; D[DashboardSidebar - 保持滚动位置和展开状态]\n    C --&gt; E[Page - 随导航重新渲染]\n    A --&gt; F[Footer]\n\n    subgraph \"导航 /dashboard/analytics → /dashboard/settings\"\n        G[RootLayout ✓保持] --&gt; H[DashboardLayout ✓保持]\n        H --&gt; I[新的 Page 组件渲染]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"路由组与平行路由\">路由组与平行路由</h2><p><strong>路由组 <code>(groupName)/</code></strong>：用圆括号包裹的文件夹不参与 URL 路径，但可以拥有独立的 <code>layout.tsx</code>。用于按功能域组织代码而不影响 URL 结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/&#10;├── (shop)/             # URL 中无 &quot;shop&quot;&#10;│   ├── layout.tsx      # 商城布局&#10;│   ├── products/...&#10;│   └── cart/...&#10;├── (marketing)/        # URL 中无 &quot;marketing&quot;&#10;│   ├── layout.tsx      # 营销布局（不同的 header/footer）&#10;│   ├── about/...&#10;│   └── blog/...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── (shop)/             # URL 中无 \"shop\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── layout.tsx      # 商城布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── products/...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── cart/...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── (marketing)/        # URL 中无 \"marketing\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── layout.tsx      # 营销布局（不同的 header/footer）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── about/...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── blog/...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>平行路由 <code>@slotName/</code></strong>：在同一布局中同时渲染多个页面，每个 slot 独立加载和导航。适用于仪表盘、模态框等多面板场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/dashboard/layout.tsx&#10;export default function DashboardLayout({&#10;  children,&#10;  analytics,&#10;  notifications,&#10;}: {&#10;  children: React.ReactNode&#10;  analytics: React.ReactNode      // @analytics/ 目录&#10;  notifications: React.ReactNode  // @notifications/ 目录&#10;}) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;grid grid-cols-12 gap-4&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;main className=&quot;col-span-8&quot;&gt;{children}&lt;/main&gt;&#10;      &lt;aside className=&quot;col-span-4 space-y-4&quot;&gt;&#10;        {analytics}&#10;        {notifications}&#10;      &lt;/aside&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/dashboard/layout.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DashboardLayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span>